{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":202169,"duration_api_ms":113138,"ttft_ms":2569,"ttft_stream_ms":2568,"time_to_request_ms":353,"num_turns":20,"result":"Iteration complete. One experiment, run, and logged.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Hypothesis (grounded in baseline notes):** The entire 0.727→1.0 gap was the 4 zero-task cases (model invents \"journal more\", \"Take a break\" from venting/musing) plus one retraction (`long_portugal` kept \"Renew passport\" after \"scratch that\"). A richer **guided schema that forces classification before extraction** should suppress invention.\n\n**Move (`exp001`, `singleShotReasoned`, greedy):** New `@Generable FMRambleSplitReasoned` with reasoning-first ordered fields:\n1. `analysis` — name the non-actionable material (venting, musing, vague wishes, retractions)\n2. `hasActionableTasks: Bool` — explicit commitment\n3. `tasks` — gated deterministically in `toContract()` (empty if the bool is false)\n\nPaired with a strengthened `reasoned` prompt carrying a worked zero-task/retraction contrast (non-gold examples, no leak).\n\n**Result:** **quality 0.967** (full set), up from 0.727 — Δ +0.24, far beyond the ~0.05 noise floor.\n- zero-task accuracy: **100%** (all 4 venting/bait cases now correctly empty)\n- `long_portugal` retraction fixed\n- extraction cases unaffected (precision 1.000, recall 0.944)\n- faithfulness 5 / atomicity 5 / actionability 5 / nonRedundancy 5; coverage 4 (residual losses are minor omitted timing/specificity details, not the zero-task lever).\n\n**New best.** Build green, one new run logged (`results/exp001.json`, `runs.jsonl` #1). The remaining headroom is now coverage-of-detail (e.g., preserving \"next month\", \"Portugal\", \"2024\" qualifiers) — a candidate for the next iteration.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2ea5bdb3-e1f1-4794-a80d-6f6ee3671b33","total_cost_usd":0.4246764999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":40,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20304,"ca