{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":491999,"duration_api_ms":323780,"ttft_ms":2045,"ttft_stream_ms":1716,"time_to_request_ms":224,"num_turns":23,"result":"Done. One experiment completed.\n\n## exp010 — verbatim-detail restyle + deterministic proper-noun recasing\n\n**Hypothesis (grounded in exp009's notes):** the residual phrasing gap is COMPLETENESS — the guard over-suppressed detail restores because the model paraphrased detail words not in the input. Fix: instruct the restyle to restore deadline/subject/recipient/location using the user's **exact words** (so restores stay inside the anti-hallucination subset guard), plus a deterministic proper-noun re-casing pass (\"dana's\" → \"Dana's\").\n\n**Result: quality 0.925 vs exp009 0.922 — +0.003, within noise (a tie, not a real best).** Build green, one new logged run, F1 held at 0.961, zero-task still 100%.\n\n**Honest read (mixed but informative):**\n- The verbatim instruction **finally moved the completeness lever** the guard had been suppressing: multi_moving recovered \"with the post office\" + \"this weekend\"; long_monday recovered \"by Thursday\" / \"for the Henderson proposal\" / \"to Mark\" / \"to Lisa\" — and these passed the guard because they reuse input words.\n- But two **new artifacts cancelled the gain**: (a) the model sometimes emits the *entire* restyle in ALL-CAPS, and `capitalizeFirst` only fixes the first char, so long_monday became shouting (\"FINISH THE DRAFT FOR THE Henderson PROPOSAL BY Thursday…\") — the judge dinged it hard; (b) it padded every multi_moving item with redundant \"for the upcoming move\".\n- Several simple cases (mixed_gym/mixed_weekend/single_plumber) still drop detail — the model just doesn't engage there.\n\n**Next lever (logged):** add a deterministic SHOUTING down-caser (lowercase all-caps restyles before capitalizeFirst+recase) to bank long_monday's already-restored detail instead of forfeiting it to caps, plus a prompt guard against appended generic framing.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"10eda3d5-0de6-44d2-8afd-593c8d0adfb6","total_cost_usd":1.37990025,"usage":{"input_tokens":46,"cache_creation_input_tokens":61025,"cache_read_input_tokens":866660,"output_tokens":22575,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":61025},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":60326,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2083,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":479,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000559,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":46,"outputTokens":22575,"cacheReadInputTokens":866660,"cacheCreationInputTokens":61025,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.37934125,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"11e6fa35-5e48-4f29-9bb6-a3dacff1cc09"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":499540,"duration_api_ms":278628,"ttft_ms":1656,"ttft_stream_ms":1651,"time_to_request_ms":152,"num_turns":31,"result":"Done. One experiment, green build, one new logged run.\n\n## exp012 — summary\n\n**Hypothesis:** Fold in exp011's prescribed (but never-run) deterministic SHOUTING down-caser and sharpen the restyle prompt to (a) force per-task detail restoration *even on the shortest single-task lists* and (b) ban appending blanket framing implied by the brain-dump's overall topic. F1 stays protected by the existing token-subset guard, so only phrasing/nonRedundancy could move.\n\n**Result: quality 0.926 — TIE with champion exp010 (0.925), +0.001 = pure noise. Discarded.**\n\nWhat the run actually showed (brutally honest):\n- **The down-caser is the one clean, real component.** long_monday's jarring ALL-CAPS is gone (phrasing 2→3) while retaining the Henderson/Thursday/Mark/Lisa detail. Worth banking.\n- **The completeness prompt failed.** Short cases still echo terse fragments — `single_plumber` stayed \"Call plumber\" (dropped \"about the kitchen sink\"), `mixed_gym` dropped \"before Friday\". Prompting will not make the model restore detail on short inputs (now failed across exp008/009/010/012).\n- **The anti-blanket-framing clause over-corrected:** `multi_moving` lost real detail + articles (\"Book moving truck\" vs exp010's \"Book the moving truck for the upcoming move\"), phrasing 4→3 — cancelling long_monday's gain.\n- New minor artifact: a standalone ALL-CAPS article \"A\" survives the down-caser (length-1 runs excluded) → \"Book A dentist\".\n\n**Insight for next iteration:** the completeness gap on short cases is not promptable; the model won't re-attach input-present detail to a 1–2 word task no matter how forcefully instructed, and pushing harder makes it strip articles. The phrasing lever has plateaued via prompting — the next real move likely needs a trained adapter or a deterministic input-detail splicer, not another prompt. Champion remains **exp010 (0.925)**.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"22372b33-d52b-4a41-bca5-a5c2e6b1b94d","total_cost_usd":1.13420975,"usage":{"input_tokens":60,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44431,"cache_read_input_tokens":833428,"output_tokens":17556,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":44431},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":706,"cache_read_input_tokens":45628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":187,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":522,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000602,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":60,"outputTokens":17556,"cacheReadInputTokens":833428,"cacheCreationInputTokens":44431,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.13360775,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a01887dd-65c5-41e0-869f-15222b76ec37"}
